Everything else in the zip is written for this project: the assembly built from this repository, the interface art, shaders and
HUD templates, manifest.json, icon.png and the documentation. No sound recording is included; audio comes from the mods that use ForgeCore.
The package is compiled against BepInEx, HarmonyX, Il2CppInterop, GTFO-API and the game's interop assemblies, which the mod manager installs
separately as the dependencies named in manifest.json; none of them is included here.
